From 7f511584b50d09dcd6ab97ecca637a6f19e8276c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 13:17:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(gi): team combo DPS in Team Settings

Pick Custom Multi Targets of each team member, with how many times each
is done per rotation. Their damage is summed and divided by a rotation
length (seconds, default 20) for team DPS, with each member's share.
Each member's targets are computed with its own team data, so values
match its Overview. The choice is stored on the team and kept through
team export/import.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
